id: pm-rust-f4sy
title: Add the missing Rust CodeQL analysis
description: "Measured 2026-09-06 across 23 fleet repositories: 22 reference github/codeql-action, while pm-rust is the only repository with no scan despite containing the native Rust CLI and SDK. GitHub default setup is not configured, and GET /repos/unbraind/pm-rust/code-scanning/alerts answered HTTP 404 with 'no analysis found' rather than returning zero alerts, which made the coverage gap look like a clean result."
