  "2026-09-06T05:23:27.097Z",pi-agent,The first successful hosted scan (CodeQL run 34013676866) completed its Analyze step and uploaded a Rust analysis. It reported 0 security results/alerts across 25 rules; extraction metrics were 21 Rust files without error and 3 with extraction errors. GET /repos/unbraind/pm-rust/code-scanning/alerts now returns HTTP 200 with an empty JSON array instead of HTTP 404 'no analysis found'. No genuine findings require separate pm items.
